	"_comment": "AUTHORED, NOT SOURCED. English glosses of the TIBETAN names, written for docs/names/rabjung.md, with the Sanskrit as a cross-check. No source publishes English for these that may be reproduced here: Sewell & Fleet prints the sixty as bare names against Kaliyuga years with no meaning column, checked directly 2026-08-21. Since 2026-08-25 the WORDING is still authored but the NAME each gloss describes is checked -- Tier A verifies that a Tibetan dictionary carries the headword and that its entry names the year this table gives it, so the column heading reads (authored, checked). Consumed by scripts/verify-rabjung-names.mjs. The Lhasa-phonetic column that used to sit here was retired when THL Simplified phonetics replaced it -- THL is a published standard and therefore verifiable, which house conventions are not. NOT a fixture: no test reads this, and nothing in src/ depends on it."
